OL,3,GNEWSA'More will turn up' - Work by
OL,4,AScottish artists unearthed for
OL,5,Ahomecoming exhibition
OL,6,
OL,7,FFor a short time, Robert Colquhoun and
OL,8,FRobert MacBryde were among the most
OL,9,Fcelebrated figures in British art.
OL,11,FThe toast of galleries, they were
OL,12,Fcommissioned to make everything from
OL,13,Fbook jackets to ballet costumes and
OL,14,Feven photographed for Vogue.
OL,16,FBut there was nothing fanciful about
OL,17,Fpainting for these working class boys
OL,18,Ffrom Ayrshire who met at Glasgow School
OL,19,Fof Art in 1933 and were partners in
OL,20,Flife and work for all their lives.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
