OL,3,GNEWSA'More will turn up' - Work by
OL,4,AScottish artists unearthed for
OL,5,Ahomecoming exhibition
OL,6,
OL,7,FArt wasn't just their passion, it was
OL,8,Ftheir currency - exchanged for food,
OL,9,Fdrinks and art supplies which allowed
OL,10,Fthem to keep the cycle going.
